#. HEY!  Keep the second-person pronoun.
#. It's mildly sarcastic (with that period
#. at the end) -- imagine a "wtf" stare as
#. in... "you HAVE too many.  The hell are
#. you tryin' to be, the whole universe?"
#. Like that.
